libinput bakes its install prefix into the quirks, plugin and tool paths. Resolve those relative to
the ELF that reads them, the tools living two levels down in libexec, and leave the host overrides
and plugins under /etc. The udev rules name the device-group callout bare so udev finds it in its
own helper directory.

--- a/meson.build
+++ b/meson.build
@@ -258,7 +258,7 @@
